<title>AUSTRALIA: Digital to set up Asia-Pacific HQ in Sydney.</title>
<headline>Digital to set up Asia-Pacific HQ in Sydney.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. computer giant Digital Equipment Corp is to set up its Asia-Pacific headquarters in Sydney, New South Wales state government treasurer Michael Egan said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Egan said the new operation would employ more than 100 local hardware and software engineers by the end of 1998, and within three years was expected to produce annual exports of A$100 million.</p>
<p>He said Digital's local customers included Australian military, telecommunications companies and it provided digital storage for local television networks.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
